violence 3 (SceneRadar: The Japanese solders charge. We see soldiers shot in the head, stabbed, slashed, burned alive, and badly injured. The captain is shot in the leg and screams in agony. Desmond tends to the injured - lifts up a wounded soldier. A few grenades explode - blowing soldiers to bits. The warships fire at the enemy positions. A soldier is mortally injured. He is given morphine but dies before he can be transported. We see the aftermath of the battle. Dead soldiers, corpses and stretchers. Desmond is still out - checks for life. When he finds an injured soldier, he drags him to the stretcher. We see a badly mangled hand. Soldiers below the cliff spot the stretchers being lowered. The Japanese close in. They spot the injured - slash the throat, and fire upon others. Desmond covers an injured soldier with mud - and hides himself. The patrol stab a corpse. They spot Desmond and fire. He crawls into a cave. They throw a grenade inside - but Desmond escapes. He spots some men hanging dead. He spots an injured man - and dresses his injuries. Desmond crawls out - and checks the corpses. A soldier fires at him. He gets a few more injured soldiers down. We see his hands bleeding. A Japanese patrol shoots at the Americans. A man is shot in the leg [blood spray]. We see the injury up close. He is dragged to safety. Desmond returns to the battlefield. He is shot in the helmet and takes cover from sniper. The captain shoots the sniper dead [blood spray]. Desmond drags an injured soldier. The soldier is hit by gunfire [blood spray] and dies. Desmond lowers the captain and another soldier. Japanese soldiers fire at him. Desmond then starts climbing down himself. When the Japanese reach the cliff and look down - they are hit by gunfire from below. We see blood spray.)

